    '575e8fbc3ec0aec0ffea1928f9e623f6fbfa28389b7b6f517a04a1443c4e043a':
      '# Context protocol index\n\nKeep the current goal and acceptance checks explicit. Read ' +
      'only the protocol needed for the current stage. Check selection.json ' +
      'byHarnessTechniques for the current harness; the shared index may include files ' +
      'selected for another harness.\n\n- [Verification evidence ' +
      'report](protocols/qa-evidence-skill.md): Use when reconciling local and CI checks into ' +
      'an honest, revision-linked QA handoff or release-readiness report.\n- [Regression ' +
      'design](protocols/qa-regression-skill.md): Use when turning a supported defect ' +
      'hypothesis into a deterministic regression and appropriately scoped verification plan.\n' +
      '- [Repair a regression](protocols/qa-regression-workflow.md): Use when a known ' +
      'regression needs a minimal fix, deterministic test and revision-linked local and CI ' +
      'verification.\n- [Validate worker return](protocols/report-contract.md): Admit a bounded ' +
      'source-linked report rather than raw worker history.\n- [Task contract in project ' +
      'guidance](protocols/task-contract.md): Keep the goal, constraints and acceptance checks explicit.\n',
