    '508226f6fa746d24165f18b00d9305fd1b412d6d42547c914ba47c543dd719f3':
      '# Context protocol index\n\nKeep the current goal and acceptance checks explicit. Read ' +
      'only the protocol needed for the current stage. Check selection.json ' +
      'byHarnessTechniques for the current harness; the shared index may include files ' +
      'selected for another harness.\n\n- [Verification evidence ' +
      'report](protocols/qa-evidence-skill.md): Use when reconciling local and CI checks into ' +
      'an honest, revision-linked QA handoff or release-readiness report.\n- [Validate release ' +
      'readiness](protocols/qa-release-workflow.md): Use when preparing a release-readiness ' +
      'assessment from scoped requirements, regression risks and actual local or CI evidence.\n' +
      '- [Failure triage](protocols/qa-triage-skill.md): Use when a QA failure needs a bounded ' +
      'reproduction and evidence-based product-versus-test classification.\n- [Validate worker ' +
      'return](protocols/report-contract.md): Admit a bounded source-linked report rather than ' +
      'raw worker history.\n- [Task contract in project guidance](protocols/task-contract.md): ' +
      'Keep the goal, constraints and acceptance checks explicit.\n',
